21, 171.1326, 170.7411, 169.3146, 168.0181, 168.2123, 169.7827, 170.0874, 170.2124, 170.6838, 171.9233, 172.9269, 173.5675, 172.8197, 172.5477, 171.8101, 173.3829, 179.3394, 185.9553, 183.4012, 186.7427, 192.039, 196.7239, 191.0488, 196.3508, 198.4287, 198.2744, 198.8027, 198.9386, 202.7894, 204.3837, 201.9983, 200.4675, 200.3599, 197.7014, 200.646, 199.8257, 197.9276, 197.7603, 195.5308, 199.3773, 199.2705, 200.9992, 196.5707, 199.4062, 197.9876, 198.6049, 198.5588, 199.153, 199.2699, 197.4824, 198.1299, 198.9525, 198.4752, 198.9833, 199.3291, 199.975, 201.2838, 201.4826, 200.7318, 198.6282, 198.0935, 198.8929, 198.2821, 199.5226, 199.2464, 199.6149, 200.5571, 200.2149, 200.4209, 201.319, 201.0723, 200.8393, 199.2722, 199.6562, 199.6417, 200.2788, 200.9432, 202.2566, 202.3466, 203.0674, 204.4542, 205.0865, 206.051, 205.3833, 204.4086, 204.6858, 203.4771, 201.2879, 201.2644, 201.8591, 201.6728, 200.3483, 201.891, 202.2586, 200.2838, 202.1582, 202.525, 203.5669, 202.405, 202.5439, 201.4973, 201.2887, 202.6449, 203.5846, 202.2017, 201.5983, 202.7817, 204.0974, 203.8743, 204.3334, 205.6933, 205.7153, 205.44, 206.7772, 207.6869, 207.4963, 205.1554, 205.9442, 207.6018, 208.6416, 210.1888, 208.1172, 205.8142, 204.7606, 202.6657, 202.5594, 203.3445, 203.4483, 202.7672, 202.7239, 203.9941, 204.7464, 204.4647, 205.9812, 206.0163, 205.4592, 205.3802, 205.0096, 202.8716, 203.5045, 201.9205, 205.5434, 205.3614, 207.8069, 206.4612, 203.1935, 205.9129, 206.979, 209.0089, 212.2577, 212.5621, 216.5727, 217.4567, 217.7265, 216.6963, 217.2374, 216.4351, 214.5222, 213.8583, 215.7998, 216.2894, 216.003, 218.015, 225.6559, 221.9219, 221.5097, 222.0724, 223.6509, 223.2103, 222.8195, 221.7739, 222.6307, 219.5376, 220.8064, 222.1512, 226.5543, 227.709, 228.2137, 229.6398, 229.9775, 229.6603, 228.8671, 225.6794, 220.801, 221.8519, 218.944, 217.8535, null], "summary_html": "<h1>复杂的企业盈余漂移越显著？ — PEAD 跨资产迁移到商品基本面意外漂移</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>研报核心是 PEAD（盈余公告后漂移）：标准化未预期盈余 SUE 较高的公司，未来一段时间收益持续高于 SUE 较低者（市场对盈余信息反应迟缓）；且信息扩散越慢（公司越复杂、越难分析）漂移越强，文中以显著为正的 SUE×Amihud 交叉项佐证。</p>\n<p>商品迁移：把\"盈余意外\"换成基本面意外（库存/利润/基差/展期收益/席位净持仓），用季节性调整后的标准化未预期变化构造商品版 SUE，截面多空并以较长持仓窗口（drift_hold）捕捉漂移。复杂度用 Amihud 非流动性代理。实证最强信号是库存意外：库存相对去年同期的标准化意外变化预测后续持续的收益漂移。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>1.4</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>5.4%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>3.9%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-5.3%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.02</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>2371</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.45</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>1.28</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.61 / 1.31</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>0.58</td><td>0.83</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.86</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.41</span></td><td>1.39</td><td>1.31</td><td>1.01</td><td>0.8</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.34</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.67</span></td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>56</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>2373</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>97.1%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>44.0</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p>商品版 SUE（对基本面字段 F，对应研报 SUE=(E_t-E_{t-4})/P 的年度同期对比）：</p>\n<p>SUE_F(t) = sign * (F_t - F_{t-252}) / (std(ΔF, 252) + eps)</p>\n<ul><li>F_{t-252}：约一年前同期值（季节性基准，类比上一年同季度 EPS）</li>\n<li>分母为 ΔF 的 252 日滚动标准差（标准化\"意外\"幅度）</li>\n<li>截面信号：s = rank_to_continuous(cr_rank_t(SUE_F)) ∈ [-1,1]</li>\n<li>复杂度乘子（combo_complex）：c = 0.5 + cr_rank_t(AMIHUD) ∈ [0.5,1.5]</li>\n<li>库存方向 sign=+1（库存上升意外 → 正向漂移，实证确定，与朴素\"低库存看多\"相反）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<ul><li>R1：实现全部 5 个基本面 SUE + 等权组合 + Amihud 复杂度加权组合。best=0.59（ry_sue_raw）。诊断发现 inv_sue_raw=-1.55（强负），库存方向符号搞反。</li>\n<li>R2：库存符号由 -1 翻成 +1；combo 剔除无效 basis_sue；加 drift_hold 网格。best 跃升 1.51（inv_sue_raw），全 gate 通过。</li>\n<li>R3：加库存 2× 加权组合 + IC-gate 库存变体确认稳健。best 维持 1.51，decision=skip。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li>频率：日频；数据 comm_data/daily/kline_daynight_all.parquet，关键字段 inventory_lp。</li>\n<li>品种：全商品期货，仅库存数据非空品种（约 56 个）生效。</li>\n<li>持仓周期：21 日换仓（漂移窗口），截面多空，vol-target 0.15。</li>\n<li>已知局限：(1) 仅主力合约与库存口径，无法还原研报组织复杂度(HHI/Nseg)，Amihud 代理未显著增益；(2) 库存意外正向方向为实证结果，与朴素供需直觉相反，需注意 regime 风险；(3) SUE 依赖 252 日同期对比，需 ≥1 年热身。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>SEASON</code></td><td><code>252</code></td><td>YoY/seasonal lag (~1yr), analog of E_{t-4}</td></tr><tr><td><code>STD_W</code></td><td><code>252</code></td><td>std window for standardizing the surprise</td></tr><tr><td><code>STD_MINP</code></td><td><code>60</code></td><td>min periods for the std window</td></tr><tr><td><code>INV_SIGN</code></td><td><code>1.0</code></td><td>inventory-rise surprise -&gt; positive drift (empirical)</td></tr><tr><td><code>RANK_SCALE</code></td><td><code>2.0</code></td><td>rank [0,1] -&gt; continuous [-1,1]</td></tr><tr><td><code>HOLD_DAYS</code></td><td><code>21</code></td><td>PEAD drift hold window</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 1.29s</li>\n</ul>"}